---
import { segStyle } from '../scroll/timeline';
---
<!-- ==================== 5. ÜBER UNS (VINCENT & JESSE) ==================== -->
<!-- Station about über der Bühne: links Text, rechts LinkedIn-Cards vor den zwei verbundenen Knoten -->
<section id="ueber-uns" data-seg="about" class="journey-block py-10 sm:py-14" style={segStyle('about')}>
    <div class="max-w-6xl w-full mx-auto px-5 sm:px-8">
        <div class="grid lg:grid-cols-[minmax(0,1fr)_30rem] gap-10 lg:gap-12 items-center">
            
            <!-- Philosophie & Text -->
            <div class="max-w-2xl space-y-6 reveal">
                <span class="text-xs font-mono uppercase tracking-widest text-inkMuted">Über uns</span>
                <h2 class="font-display text-2xl sm:text-4xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-ink leading-tight">
                    „Kein KI-Hype ohne echten Nutzen – wir verbinden tiefes Data-Science-Verständnis mit pragmatischer Umsetzung.“
                </h2>
                <p class="text-base text-inkMuted leading-relaxed">
                    Uns verbindet nicht nur das gemeinsame Studium: Wir haben bereits beim gleichen Arbeitgeber mehrere Daten- und KI-Projekte gemeinsam in der Praxis gemeistert. Als zwei vielseitige Generalisten auf Augenhöhe decken wir beide die gesamte Strecke von der Datenmodellierung bis zur fertigen KI-Anwendung ab.
                </p>
                <p class="text-base text-inkMuted leading-relaxed">
                    Im Gegensatz zu reinen Hype-Agenturen, die nur Standard-Vorlagen zusammenklicken, bringen wir echtes Data-Science- und Software-Engineering-Fundament mit. Wenn ihr mit <strong>vinje</strong> arbeitet, sprecht ihr direkt mit den Entwicklern, die Systeme wie <strong>backmail</strong> und <strong>backcall</strong> sowie eure individuellen Python-Pipelines und KI-Modelle bauen.
                </p>

            </div>

            <!-- Vincent & Jesse (Logo, Namenszeile und Claim stehen bereits in Header, Hero und Footer) -->
            <div class="reveal">
                <div class="relative rounded-2xl border border-silverBorder bg-paper p-7 sm:p-9 lg:p-5 shadow-[0_20px_50px_-22px_rgba(24,24,24,0.14)] overflow-hidden">
                    <!-- Dezenter silbriger Wellenakzent in der Ecke -->
                    <div class="pointer-events-none absolute -right-12 -bottom-12 w-56 h-56 rounded-full bg-gradient-to-tr from-[#D5D3CA]/60 via-white/80 to-transparent blur-xl"></div>
                    
                    <div class="relative">

                        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-4">
                            <a
                                href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/vincent-grueneklee"
                                target="_blank"
                                rel="noopener noreferrer"
                                class="group p-4 rounded-xl bg-white/85 border border-silverBorder hover:border-ink hover:bg-white transition-all flex flex-col justify-between"
                                aria-label="Vincent Grüneklee auf LinkedIn"
                            >
                                <div>
                                    <div class="flex items-center justify-between gap-2 mb-3">
                                        <div class="w-14 h-14 rounded-full overflow-hidden border border-silverBorder ring-2 ring-paper shrink-0">
                                            <img
                                                src="./images/vincent.jpg"
                                                alt="Vincent Grüneklee"
                                                width="112"
                                                height="112"
                                                loading="lazy"
                                                class="w-full h-full object-cover object-center transition-transform duration-500 group-hover:scale-105"
                                            />
                                        </div>
                                        <span class="p-1.5 rounded-lg bg-paper border border-silverBorder text-inkMuted group-hover:text-ink group-hover:border-ink transition-colors" title="LinkedIn Profil">
                                            <svg class="w-3.5 h-3.5" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor" aria-hidden="true">
                                                <path d="M19 3a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v14a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V5a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h14m-.5 15.5v-5.3a3.26 3.26 0 0 0-3.26-3.26c-.85 0-1.84.52-2.28 1.3v-1.11h-2.79v8.37h2.79v-4.93c0-.77.62-1.4 1.39-1.4a1.4 1.4 0 0 1 1.4 1.4v4.93h2.75M6.88 8.56a1.68 1.68 0 0 0 1.68-1.68c0-.93-.75-1.69-1.68-1.69a1.69 1.69 0 0 0-1.69 1.69c0 .93.76 1.68 1.69 1.68m1.39 9.94v-8.37H5.5v8.37h2.77z"/>
                                            </svg>
                                        </span>
                                    </div>
                                    <div class="font-display font-semibold text-sm text-ink group-hover:underline">Vincent Grüneklee</div>
                                    <div class="text-xs text-inkMuted mt-1 leading-relaxed">Data Science, KI-Systeme &amp; Automatisierung</div>
                                </div>
                                <div class="mt-3 pt-2.5 border-t border-silverBorder/70 flex items-center justify-between text-[11px] font-mono text-inkMuted group-hover:text-ink transition-colors">
                                    <span>LinkedIn</span>
                                    <span>↗</span>
                                </div>
                            </a>

                            <a
                                href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/jessebakenhus"
                                target="_blank"
                                rel="noopener noreferrer"
                                class="group p-4 rounded-xl bg-white/85 border border-silverBorder hover:border-ink hover:bg-white transition-all flex flex-col justify-between"
                                aria-label="Jesse Bakenhus auf LinkedIn"
                            >
                                <div>
                                    <div class="flex items-center justify-between gap-2 mb-3">
                                        <div class="w-14 h-14 rounded-full overflow-hidden border border-silverBorder ring-2 ring-paper shrink-0">
                                            <img
                                                src="./images/jesse.jpg"
                                                alt="Jesse Bakenhus"
                                                width="112"
                                                height="112"
                                                loading="lazy"
                                                class="w-full h-full object-cover object-center transition-transform duration-500 group-hover:scale-105"
                                            />
                                        </div>
                                        <span class="p-1.5 rounded-lg bg-paper border border-silverBorder text-inkMuted group-hover:text-ink group-hover:border-ink transition-colors" title="LinkedIn Profil">
                                            <svg class="w-3.5 h-3.5" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor" aria-hidden="true">
                                                <path d="M19 3a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v14a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V5a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h14m-.5 15.5v-5.3a3.26 3.26 0 0 0-3.26-3.26c-.85 0-1.84.52-2.28 1.3v-1.11h-2.79v8.37h2.79v-4.93c0-.77.62-1.4 1.39-1.4a1.4 1.4 0 0 1 1.4 1.4v4.93h2.75M6.88 8.56a1.68 1.68 0 0 0 1.68-1.68c0-.93-.75-1.69-1.68-1.69a1.69 1.69 0 0 0-1.69 1.69c0 .93.76 1.68 1.69 1.68m1.39 9.94v-8.37H5.5v8.37h2.77z"/>
                                            </svg>
                                        </span>
                                    </div>
                                    <div class="font-display font-semibold text-sm text-ink group-hover:underline">Jesse Bakenhus</div>
                                    <div class="text-xs text-inkMuted mt-1 leading-relaxed">Data Science, KI-Systeme &amp; Automatisierung</div>
                                </div>
                                <div class="mt-3 pt-2.5 border-t border-silverBorder/70 flex items-center justify-between text-[11px] font-mono text-inkMuted group-hover:text-ink transition-colors">
                                    <span>LinkedIn</span>
                                    <span>↗</span>
                                </div>
                            </a>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="mt-6 px-1 grid sm:grid-cols-3 gap-6 text-sm">
                    <div>
                        <div class="font-display font-semibold text-ink">Eingespieltes Duo</div>
                        <div class="text-xs text-inkMuted">Aus Studium &amp; gemeinsamer Berufspraxis</div>
                    </div>
                    <div>
                        <div class="font-display font-semibold text-ink">Echte Expertise</div>
                        <div class="text-xs text-inkMuted">Data Science &amp; Engineering statt Hype</div>
                    </div>
                    <div>
                        <div class="font-display font-semibold text-ink">Direkter Draht</div>
                        <div class="text-xs text-inkMuted">Zwei Generalisten ohne Agentur-Umwege</div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>
